Rules for building C/API module with f2py2e.

Here is a skeleton of a new wrapper function (13Dec2001):

wrapper_function(args)
  declarations
  get_python_arguments, say, `a' and `b'

  get_a_from_python
  if (successful) {

    get_b_from_python
    if (successful) {

      callfortran
      if (successful) {

        put_a_to_python
        if (successful) {

          put_b_to_python
          if (successful) {

            buildvalue = ...

          }

        }

      }

    }
    cleanup_b

  }
  cleanup_a

  return buildvalue

