r9␀␀␀Ú__main__)r7␀␀␀zF2PY Versionz;http://cens.ioc.ee/projects/f2py2e/2.x/F2PY-2-latest.tar.gzÚdownload_urlz+Development Status :: 5 - Production/StablezIntended Audience :: Developersz%Intended Audience :: Science/Researchz(License :: OSI Approved :: NumPy LicensezNatural Language :: Englishz"Operating System :: OS IndependentzProgramming Language :: CzProgramming Language :: FortranzProgramming Language :: PythonzTopic :: Scientific/Engineeringz0Topic :: Software Development :: Code GeneratorsÚclassifiersz,F2PY - Fortran to Python Interface GeneratonzPearu Petersonzpearu@cens.ioc.eeÚBSDz%Unix, Windows (mingw|cygwin), Mac OSXaM␀␀The Fortran to Python Interface Generator, or F2PY for short, is a
command line tool (f2py) for generating Python C/API modules for
wrapping Fortran 77/90/95 subroutines, accessing common blocks from
