        Reduce a mask to nomask when possible.

        Parameters
        ----------
        None

        Returns
        -------
        None

        Examples
        --------
        >>> x = np.ma.array([[1,2 ], [3, 4]], mask=[0]*4)
        >>> x.mask
        array([[False, False],
               [False, False]])
        >>> x.shrink_mask()
        >>> x.mask
        False

