    arr : array_like
        The indices will be valid for square arrays whose dimensions are
        the same as arr.
    k : int, optional
        Diagonal offset (see `tril` for details).

    See Also
    --------
    tril_indices, tril

    Notes
    -----
    .. versionadded:: 1.4.0

