zloadtxt.<locals>.split_linec␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀3␀␀␀sÀ␀␀␀g␀}x¬t␀tjˆgˆƒƒD␀]–\}}ˆ|ƒ‰␀tˆ␀ƒdkr6qˆ	rL‡␀fdd„ˆ	D␀ƒ‰␀tˆ␀ƒˆkrp|ˆ␀d␀}td|␀ƒ‚dd„␀tˆˆ␀ƒD␀ƒ}ˆ|ˆƒ}|j|ƒ␀t|ƒ|␀kr|V␀␀g␀}qW␀|r¼|V␀␀dS␀)a␀␀Parse each line, including the first.

        The file read, `fh`, is a global defined above.

        Parameters
        ----------
        chunk_size : int
            At most `chunk_size` lines are read at a time, with iteration
            until all lines are read.

