    Return the indices of the maximum values in the specified axis ignoring
    NaNs. For all-NaN slices ``ValueError`` is raised. Warning: the
    results cannot be trusted if a slice contains only NaNs and -Infs.


    Parameters
    ----------
    a : array_like
        Input data.
