isinstanceÚtupleri␀␀␀ÚasarrayZndarrayÚreshaperc␀␀␀ra␀␀␀r+␀␀␀r,␀␀␀)Úxr8␀␀␀Útensorr:␀␀␀r;␀␀␀rR␀␀␀r/␀␀␀r<␀␀␀r0␀␀␀r0␀␀␀r1␀␀␀r␀␀␀R␀␀s,␀␀␀␀E
