    Return (a * i), that is string multiple concatenation,
    element-wise.

    Values in `i` of less than 0 are treated as 0 (which yields an
    empty string).

    Parameters
    ----------
    a : array_like of str or unicode

    i : array_like of ints

    Returns
    -------
